{"id":"269d3ee333e7fa0e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Domain Projection","display":"df-zfc-set10-domain-projection — ZFC Set10 Domain Projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-domain-projection — ZFC Set10 Domain Projection","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-domain-projection — ZFC Set10 Domain Projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d16bb1d9ed41c\" href=\"?note=599d16bb1d9ed41c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair\">58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R,x,y\\in V\">\\(D,R,x,y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\)</span> (typed relation-domain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}domain\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}domain\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the compatibility name for the canonical relation-domain predicate, which both computes the first-coordinate projection and excludes non-pair junk from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair","status":"resolved","id":"599d16bb1d9ed41c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-ordered-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S$ (typed relation-domain predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"D,R,x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}domain\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10DomainProjection}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":991,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3379","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection.md|58-df-zfc-set10-domain-projection]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","97c28eede56ea5e4","599d16bb1d9ed41c"]}